OL,3,CTributes paid to two men found dead
OL,4,Ctogether in car
OL,6,FThe "heartbroken" families of two men
OL,7,Ffound dead inside a car hidden "in
OL,8,Fthick undergrowth" 10 days after they
OL,9,Fwere last seen have paid emotional
OL,10,Ftributes to them.
OL,12,FStuart Tallis, 27, and 31-year-old
OL,13,FWilliam Hutchinson were reported
OL,14,Fmissing separately from their homes in
OL,15,FPreston, Lancashire, in June 2026.
OL,17,FFollowing enquiries, Lancashire Police
OL,18,Fofficers believed the two men may have
OL,19,Fbeen together and launched a targeted
OL,20,Fsearch to find them.
OL,26,@oD@`OUpD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
