CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786038507
OL,3,CTributes paid to two men found dead
OL,4,Ctogether in car
OL,6,FShortly after midday on 4 July, 10
OL,7,Fdays after they were reported missing,
OL,8,Fspecialist search officers discovered
OL,9,FWilliam's car hidden from view in
OL,10,Fthick undergrowth off the A584 Preston
OL,11,FNew Road.
OL,13,FBoth men were found dead inside the
OL,14,Fcar.
OL,16,FPaying tribute, Stuart's family
OL,17,Fdescribed him as "more than a brother
OL,18,Fand son" and called him their best
OL,19,Ffriend.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786038507
OL,3,CTributes paid to two men found dead
OL,4,Ctogether in car
OL,6,F"His smile, laughter, and kind heart
OL,7,Fcould light up a room and make even
OL,8,Fthe darkest days feel brighter," they
OL,9,Fsaid in a statement.
OL,11,F"While our hearts are broken by his
OL,12,Floss, we find comfort in the beautiful
OL,13,Fmemories we shared with him. We will
OL,14,Fcherish those memories forever and
OL,15,Fcarry them with us every day.
OL,17,F"We love you, Stu, forever and always.
OL,18,FYou will never be forgotten."
OL,20,FHis mother added: "R.I.P. Son. You are
OL,21,Falways in my heart. Love forever, Mum."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786038507
OL,3,CTributes paid to two men found dead
OL,4,Ctogether in car
OL,6,FWilliam's family remembered him as a
OL,7,F"lovable rogue" with a larger-than-
OL,8,Flife personality who was a devoted
OL,9,Fpartner and a proud father to two
OL,10,Fyoung children.
OL,12,FThey said: "He was truly one of a
OL,13,Fkind. He had the gift of the gab,
OL,14,Fcould make friends wherever he went,
OL,15,Fand had a remarkable ability to bring
OL,16,Flaughter and warmth to those around
OL,17,Fhim.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786038507
OL,3,CTributes paid to two men found dead
OL,4,Ctogether in car
OL,6,F"Above all, William had a heart of
OL,7,Fgold. He was fiercely loyal to those
OL,8,Fhe loved and would do anything for his
OL,9,Ffamily and friends.
OL,11,F"His kindness, humour and unique
OL,12,Fcharacter touched so many lives, and
OL,13,Fhis loss has left an immense void that
OL,14,Fcan never be filled."
OL,16,FThey added that they are still
OL,17,Fstruggling to come to terms with the
OL,18,F"devastating tragedy" and expressed
OL,19,Ftheir gratitude for the outpouring of
OL,20,Fsympathy from the local community.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786038507
OL,3,CTributes paid to two men found dead
OL,4,Ctogether in car
OL,6,F"As a family, we would like to thank
OL,7,Feveryone for the overwhelming support,
OL,8,Fkindness and messages of condolence we
OL,9,Fhave received," they said.
OL,11,F"Your thoughtful words, memories and
OL,12,Fgestures of support have brought great
OL,13,Fcomfort during the most difficult time
OL,14,Fof our lives. William was truly one in
OL,15,Fa million, and he will be loved,
OL,16,Fremembered and missed forever."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
